{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20241227\/20241227100915_61637.png","category_id":"6a157626b0cd2e35d86fcf74","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2024-12-27 10:08:04","details":"<p>\r\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20241227\/20241227100844_48504.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\tmPEG-GAA，即甲氧基聚乙二醇戊二酰胺酸，是一种特殊的PEG（聚乙二醇）衍生物。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t官能团结构\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<p>\r\n\tmPEG-GAA的官能团主要由PEG链段、C4脂肪酰胺键和羧基（COOH）组成。其中，PEG链段是一种亲水性的聚合物链，具有良好的生物相容性和稳定性；C4脂肪酰胺键则是连接PEG链段和羧基的关键部分，它赋予了mPEG-GAA特定的化学性质和反应活性。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t官能团特性\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t亲水性与生物相容性：由于PEG链段的存在，mPEG-GAA具有良好的亲水性和生物相容性。这使得mPEG-GAA在生物体内应用中能够减少蛋白质的吸附和细胞的黏附，从而提高其生物利用度和稳定性。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t反应活性：C4脂肪酰胺键使得mPEG-GAA能够与氨基和肽偶联剂（如NHS、DCC和EDC等）发生反应。这种反应活性使得mPEG-GAA能够与其他生物分子（如蛋白质、肽类等）进行偶联或修饰，从而赋予这些生物分子新的功能和性质。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t多功能性：羧基（COOH）作为mPEG-GAA的另一个重要官能团，具有多种化学反应性。它可以参与酯化、酰胺化等多种化学反应，进一步拓展了mPEG-GAA的应用范围。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t应用领域\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t药物传递系统：mPEG-GAA可以作为药物的载体或修饰剂，通过其反应活性与药物分子进行偶联，从而提高药物的稳定性和生物利用度。同时，PEG链段的亲水性也有助于改善药物的溶解度和分散性。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t生物医学应用：在生物医学领域，mPEG-GAA可用于制备生物材料、生物传感器等。通过其官能团的反应活性，mPEG-GAA能够与生物分子进行偶联或修饰，从而赋予这些生物材料新的功能和性质。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t高分子材料改性：mPEG-GAA还可以作为高分子材料的改性剂，通过其官能团的反应活性与高分子材料进行共聚或交联，从而提高材料的稳定性和生物相容性。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>产品技术优势<\/strong><\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">赛诺邦格提供高质量PEG衍生物，具有产品结构新颖多样，取代基团丰富，端基取代率高等特点。\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<ul font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li>\r\n\t高PEG官能团含量-含量可高达99%\r\n<\/li>\r\n\t<\/ul>\r\n<blockquote font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\tPEG的官能化，是PEG产品中最有难度的。市场上主要产品存在的普遍问题是官能团含量不高。而我们掌握的修饰技术、引发体系、非常规沉淀法和系统萃取法等技术和工艺可以轻松制得高官能团含量的产品。大部分产品的官能团含量可达99%，比对手的90%左右高得多。\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t<\/blockquote>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br \/>\r\n\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n<ul font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t高质量PEG分子量控制-PDI &lt;1.05\r\n\t\t\t<\/li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\r\n<blockquote font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t聚合物的单分子链通常来说是由许多小分子重复单元通过聚合的方法连接而得。合成方法的设计和控制对实现单个高分子链段的长度，以及多个聚合物链段的长度相似程度有至关重要的影响。我们的PEG合成技术能保证非常好的分散度（PDI&lt;1.05)，而许多其他 公司的产品一般PDI仅在1.1左右。\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<br \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\r\n<h3 class=\"Editable-styled\" background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span>相关推荐：<\/span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\r\n<div class=\"TableToolbar-container\" font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\